<title>NEW ZEALAND: RUGBY LEAGUE-NEW ZEALAND TROUNCE PAPUA NEW GUINEA 64-0.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-NEW ZEALAND TROUNCE PAPUA NEW GUINEA 64-0.</headline>
<dateline>PALMERSTON NORTH, New Zealand 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>New</p>
<p>Zealand beat Papua New Guinea 64-0 (halftime 30-0) in the second</p>
<p>rugby league test at the Palmerston North showgrounds on Friday.</p>
<p>Tries: Stacey Jones (2), Gene Ngamu (2), Grant Young, Ruben</p>
<p>Wiki, Sean Hoppe, Richard Barnett, Joe Vagana, Marc Ellis,</p>
<p>Stephen Kearney, Richie Blackmore; Goals: Matthew Ridge (8).</p>
